  "display_title": "Electric Reverse Love",
  "description": "For years, Park Ji-Woon has been quietly in love with Kang Soo-Hyuk. Soo-Hyuk notices Ji-Woon’s feelings and begins to use him like a toy, indulging his own desires without restraint. As long as he can stay close to Soo-Hyuk, Ji-Woon tells himself that being used is better than nothing. But Soo-Hyuk’s cold and careless treatment slowly wears him down. Then one day, Ji-Woon receives a mysterious package. Inside the box, he finds a strange cord and a note. Taking it as his last hope, he decides to try using the cord on Soo-Hyuk. From that moment on, something feels different. \n\n *“Trash like you deserves to be punished and taught a lesson. So obey me.”*\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
